\end{ex}

In Example~\ref{ex:ex2}, the task is to summarize a narrative-style news article. The target summary should cover all of the key elements of the news story, and reflect the main themes and points.  This task is very difficult as it requires the summarizer to understand the structure of the text, and make judgments about what information is most important.


